WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.768 align:start size:94% position:6%
-All right, here's how
this works.

00:00:01.768 --> 00:00:03.436 align:start size:94% position:6%
Michael Strahan,
you will start the round

00:00:03.436 --> 00:00:04.738 align:start size:94% position:6%
by pressing start
on this buzzer, okay?

00:00:04.738 --> 00:00:07.340
And then drawing a clue from
the top of the pile right there.

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:10.010 align:start size:94% position:6%
You have to get your teammate
to guess the clue

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:10.677 size:81% position:41% line:92%
as quickly as possible

00:00:10.677 --> 00:00:12.846
and then hand the buzzer off
to the person on your right.

00:00:12.846 --> 00:00:15.548
You can make any physical
gesture, say whatever you want.

00:00:15.548 --> 00:00:17.617 align:start size:94% position:6%
You can't say any word
in the actual clue.

00:00:17.617 --> 00:00:19.285 align:start size:94% position:6%
Is it too long already?
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.285 --> 00:00:21.621 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We could have already
played a round.

00:00:21.621 --> 00:00:22.155 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:22.155 --> 00:00:24.290 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But if you're holding
the buzzer when it goes off,

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:25.091 line:92%
your team loses that round.

00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:27.494 align:start size:94% position:6%
We're gonna play three rounds.
Let's take our positions.

00:00:27.494 --> 00:00:30.096 align:start size:94% position:6%
Michael, you go here.
Other Michael, you go there.

00:00:30.096 --> 00:00:31.865 line:92%
-Michael, you're over there.

00:00:31.865 --> 00:00:32.399 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Excuse me.

00:00:32.399 --> 00:00:33.800 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Here we go.
All right, here we go.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:37.303 align:start size:94% position:6%
-How you doing, man?
-Come on, come on, cut it out.

00:00:37.303 --> 00:00:39.539 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:39.539 --> 00:00:41.441 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Here we go, man. Come on.
This is it.

00:00:41.441 --> 00:00:42.776 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Tell me when you're ready.
-Yeah.

00:00:42.776 --> 00:00:46.146
-Tell me when you're ready.
-We're ready. Ready. Okay.

00:00:46.146 --> 00:00:49.916 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
